{"id":"services-immo","title":"Immobilier","source":"minitel/services/general/immo.txt","lines":["  Immobilier","","  Code de service  Tarif (FF HT/min)","----------------------------------------","  BURCOM  3,35","  Serveur permettant d'obtenir des","informations sur les bureaux, les","  commerces, les locaux industriels et","commerciaux ou les terrains","  disponibles. Il présente également","l'évolution des cotes de","  l'immobilier d'entreprise.","----------------------------------------","  FNAIM  2,30","  Des appartements, des locaux","commerciaux ou des locations de","  vacances: la Fédération Nationale des","Agents Immobiliers compile","  l'ensemble de ses annonces","immobilières. A voir, la rubrique","  \"location\" : vous laissez un message","concernant l'appartement ou la","  maison que vous voulez louer et la","FNAIM vous dira si elle a ce que","  vous cherchez.","----------------------------------------","  LACENTRALE  1,51","  La Centrale des Particuliers propose :","annonces de locations, ventes,","  viager, en France et à l'étranger.","----------------------------------------","  PAP  1,51","  L'immobilier sans agence sur le","service de Particulier à Particulier.","  Offres et demandes, locaux","commerciaux... A consulter, la rubrique","  \"calculs rapides\" : PAP vous calculera","vos frais de notaire,","  plus-values ou vos remboursements pour","un crédit sur 10, 15, 20","  ans...","----------------------------------------","  PARISNOTAI  1,51","  A n'utiliser que pour connaître les","dates et lieux des ventes aux","  enchères et l'annuaire de 400 notaires","parisiens. Des informations","  sur la profession de notaire (études,","rémunération, prestation...) et","  les chiffres du marché immobilier à","Paris et en région parisienne.","----------------------------------------","  URBA  1,51","  Des informations toutes fraîches sur","l'urbanisme et l'aménagement du","  territoire, des adresses utiles (les","directions départementales de","  l'équipement, les fédérations","d'architectes...) sur le service du","  Ministère de l'Equipement. A voir, la","rubrique \"actualité\" : les","  décisions gouvernementales, les","derniers décrets, leurs conséquences","  au niveau national ou local."]}